{"dct_title_s":"National Rail Network 1:100,000 Nodes","dct_description_sm":["Abstract: The Rail Network is a comprehensive database of the nation's railway system including all railway mainlines, railroad yards, and major sidings in the continental U.S. at the 1:100,000 scale. The data set covers the 48 contiguous States plus the District of Columbia.","Purpose: The data set provides location and partial attribute information for use in national and regional network analysis applications."],"dct_creator_sm":["Bureau of Transportation Statistics, comp."],"dct_publisher_sm":["Bureau of Transportation Statistics"],"schema_provider_s":"Harvard","gbl_resourceClass_sm":["Datasets"],"gbl_resourceType_sm":["Point data"],"dct_subject_sm":["Rail","Railroads"],"dcat_theme_sm":["Transportation"],"dct_temporal_sm":["2000"],"dct_issued_s":"2001","gbl_indexYear_im":[2000],"dct_spatial_sm":["United States"],"locn_geometry":"ENVELOPE(-124.478995,-66.98382,49.001646,25.439874)","dcat_bbox":"ENVELOPE(-124.478995,-66.98382,49.001646,25.439874)","dct_rights_sm":["Use constraints: For Non-commercial use only. Acknowledgment of the Bureau of Transportation Statistics National Transportation Atlas would be appreciated in products derived from these data.","Access constraints: None"],"dct_accessRights_s":"Public","dct_format_s":"Shapefile","dct_references_s":"{\"http://www.opengis.net/cat/csw/csdgm\":\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/harvard-library/harvard-geodata/main/fgdc/NTADRAIL100KND.xml\",\"http://schema.org/downloadUrl\":\"https://mps.lib.harvard.edu/assets/file/hgl:NTADRAIL100KND\",\"https://github.com/protomaps/PMTiles\":\"https://hgl.harvard.edu/data/public/NTADRAIL100KND.pmtiles\"}","id":"harvard-ntadrail100knd","gbl_mdModified_dt":"2002-07-05T00:00:00Z","gbl_mdVersion_s":"Aardvark","dct_language_sm":["eng"],"dct_identifier_sm":["https://hgl.harvard.edu/catalog/harvard-ntadrail100knd","NTADRAIL100KND","https://id.lib.harvard.edu/alma/990087238870203941/catalog"],"gbl_wxsIdent